# Ignore file for uap-indexer/Dockerfile specifically (BuildKit prefers
# "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" over the context-root ".dockerignore" when
# both exist). The build context for this Dockerfile is contrib/, not
# uap-indexer/ -- see the invocation documented at the top of the
# Dockerfile -- so paths here are relative to contrib/.
#
# None of this is required for the build to succeed; it just keeps dev
# tooling, test files, and node_modules (irrelevant to a Go binary) out of
# what gets uploaded to the Docker daemon as build context and out of any
# intermediate layer.
**/node_modules
**/*_test.go
**/*.test.js
**/*.integration.test.js

uap-indexer/Dockerfile
uap-indexer/Dockerfile.dockerignore
uap-indexer/.dockerignore
uap-indexer/README.md
uap-indexer/web/
uap-indexer/uap-indexer
uap-indexer/uap-indexer-stripped
uap-indexer/uap-indexer.upx
